   One reusable icon-led title system for:
   - Dashboard operational panels
   - People summary, directory, create, and batch cards
   - Setup workspace group headers generated by JavaScript

   Page-level headers and inner form/table headings intentionally remain
   text-led so the interface does not become visually noisy.
   Existing IDs, actions, collapse controls, data rendering, and business
   behaviour are unchanged.
