/* =========================================================
   SETUP WORKSPACE MODERNISATION - STEP 1

   Presentation-only redesign for the complete Setup workspace.

   Product rules:
   - Group headers keep one restrained icon per setup category.
   - Individual setup cards use typography, a slim accent rail, and spacing
     instead of repeating a large icon on every card.
   - Existing IDs, forms, buttons, collapse controls, access rules, Supabase
     queries, tenant filters, save/edit handlers, and record renderers remain
     unchanged.
   - Every setup records area receives the same desktop table, empty-state,
     contained-scroll, and mobile stacked-card treatment.
